Numbers confirmed:
- Brick tunneling (vertical): max step > brick_h + 2·r = 34 → level ≥ 6 (35.5).
- Paddle band skip: max step > paddle_h = 12 → level ≥ 1 at max dt (13) — the ball can skip the paddle band even at level 1 on a 50ms frame. Actually more precisely, at 60fps (16.7ms) L1 step = 4.3 < 12 → safe; at 30fps (33ms) L1 = 8.7 < 12 safe; L2 33ms → 11.6 < 12 borderline; L3 33ms → 14.5 > 12 → skips. And at 50ms any level. The trigger: step > 12 px → level 3 at 30 fps, or any level at 50 ms.

